# 🚀 LaunchSignal Environment Configuration Template

This project contains a separate configuration template for both the backend and frontend services.
Please copy the templates to `.env` in their respective folders:

## 1. Backend Service
Copy [backend/.env.example](backend/.env.example) to `backend/.env` and fill in the values:
```bash
cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
```

## 2. Frontend Service
Copy [frontend/.env.example](frontend/.env.example) to `frontend/.env` and fill in the values:
```bash
cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
```
